    {
      "id": "content-contract",
      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "Contract",
      "position": {
        "x": 510,
        "y": -50
      },
      "width": 720,
      "height": 380,
      "data": {
        "title": "Contract",
        "body": "Write `data.content = { kind, value }`. The current reader accepts markdown, html, svg, canvas, text, json and image. Image values may be a source string or an object with src/alt/fit; canvas uses an object payload. JSON values are stringified for preview. Unknown kinds fall back to text. Content is written as content.kind/value and nothing else.",
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "Article"
          },
          "baseLevel": "detail"
        },
