      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "Behavior",
      "position": {
        "x": 2190,
        "y": -50
      },
      "width": 720,
      "height": 380,
      "data": {
        "title": "Behavior",
        "body": "`resolveContentPayload` normalizes the payload; `resolveViewContent` finds delegated material. ContentNode and ViewContentPayload render the supported material through the existing payload renderers. A face may instead own its own data.content.",
